# The build context is the repository root; the image needs the Python package and nothing else. Everything is
# left out first (.git, tests/, web/ and its node_modules and .next, plugins/, deploy/, caches), then the files the
# wheel is built from are let back in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!MANIFEST.in
!evo_agents/
# Caches that can sit inside the package directory.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.DS_Store
